# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Personal local Claude instructions
CLAUDE.local.md

# Gum bundle output (produced by `gumcli pack`; loose source is checked in)
**/*.gumpkg

# Gum's own baked font atlases, regenerated by the Gum Tool/gumcli next to a project's .gumx/.gumj
# whenever a Text uses a system/registered font family name. Not used when a project's fonts are
# assigned as project-relative .ttf paths (dynamic KernSmith generation reads the .ttf directly).
**/GumProject/FontCache/

# Content prefetch manifest generated at build time by FlatRedBall2.BlazorGL's
# build/*.targets into each web project's wwwroot/
**/wwwroot/content-manifest.json

# Visual Studio / Rider / IDE
**/.vs/

# C# Dev Kit language-service cache (safe to delete, auto-regenerated per its own header)
**/*.lscache

# Per-machine Claude settings
**/settings.local.json

# Engine / tooling scratch
.claude/skill_change_log.jsonl
/.claude/worktrees
/.claude/hooks
/design/edc
/out

# Per-issue launch script — created fresh by the agent for each issue worktree.
# Never commit: each issue needs its own content and a tracked version would
# reappear as a stale "previous issue" file in every new worktree.
/run.ps1

# Manual-test-only scratch projects (a human clicks/listens to confirm a feature works, no new
# engineering finding to preserve) live here, one shared folder for all of them, and never get
# committed — unlike a feasibility spike under diagnostics/ (e.g. MusicPitchSpike), which
# documents a finding and is kept as repo history.
diagnostics/manual-test/

# Sample folders intentionally excluded from source control
/samples/auto
/samples/SlopesSample

